ge-submersible-pump\" id=\"6872872\">Sewage Submersible Pump</a><ul class=\"sub-menu\">\n<li class=\"LiLevel2\"><a href=\"/sewage-submersible-pump/ss-submersible-sewage-pump-with-float-switch\" id=\"6872928\">SS Submersible Sewage Pump with Float Switch</a></li>\n<li class=\"LiLevel2\"><a href=\"/sewage-submersible-pump/submersible-sewage-pump-with-grinder\" id=\"6872929\">Submersible Sewage Pump with Grinder</a></li>\n</ul></li>\n<li class=\"menu-item LiLevel1\" id=\"LeftNavCat14\"><a href=\"/self-suction-screw-pump\" id=\"6872880\">Self Suction Screw Pump</a></li>\n<li class=\"menu-item LiLevel1\" id=\"LeftNavCat15\"><a href=\"/submersible-solar-pump\" id=\"7719400\">Submersible Solar Pump</a></li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"con_title\">Contact Us</div>\n<div class=\"contact_box\"><p>JD Frontier</p><p>ADD: City Saddar Road, Rawalpindi, Pakistan</p><p>TEL: <a href=\"tel:+92515553023\">051-5553023</a></p></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pro_right\">\n<div class=\"pror_wrap\">\n<div class=\"pror_detail\">\n<div class=\"fl\"><div class=\"singglepic\"><img alt=\"Solar Submersible Impeller Pump\" border=\"0\" src=\"/uploads/201816806/4-inch-submersible-impeller-pump25226240027.jpg\"/></div><link href=\"/images/spic.css\" rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\"/></div>\n<div class=\"fr\">\n<h1 class=\"title-h1\">Solar Submersible Impeller Pump</h1>\n<p>JIADI 4 inch submersible impeller pump are suitable for use with clean water with a sand content of no more than 150 g/m³. As a result of their high efficiency and reliability, they are suitable for use in domestic,...</p>\n<a class=\"special_read\" href=\"#p1\" rel=\"nofollow\">Send Inquiry</a>\n<div class=\"share-btn-list\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"watch_botton\">\n<div class=\"button_box\">\n<button class=\"the_first\">Product Details</button>\n<p><input id=\"productID\" name=\"productID\" type=\"hidden\" value=\"62112556\"/></p><p><strong>4 inch submersible impeller pump</strong><br/></p><p><img alt=\"微信图片_20181219133847\" src=\"/Content/upload/2019348866/201901091705288570368.jpg\" title=\"微信图片_20181219133847\"/></p><p>JIADI 4 inch submersible impeller pump are suitable for use with clean water with a sand content of no more than 150 g/m³.</p><p>As a result of their high efficiency and reliability, they are suitable for use in domestic, civil, agricultural and industrial applications such as for the distribution of water in combination with pressure sets, for irrigation, for washing plants and for pressure boosting in fire-fighting sets, etc.</p><p><strong>1. Product Parameter (specification)</strong></p><p><strong>Categories:</strong> submersible pumps</p><p><strong>Flow </strong>(m3/h):8</p><p><strong>Head </strong>(m): 1 /338</p><p><strong>Power</strong> (kW): 0.25 / 5.5</p><p><strong>Construction:</strong></p><p>Submersible motor pumps for deep wells of 4″ (DN 100 mm).</p><p>Sized for connection to the motor according to NEMA Standards.</p><p>Delivery casing with built-in non-return valve.</p><p>Delivery port G 1 1/4. Radial floating impeller with high reliability operating in sandy water.</p><p><strong>Performance:</strong></p><p>Capacity up to 8 m3/h.</p><p>Head up to 338m.</p><p>Rated motor power output up to 5.5 kW.</p><p>Rotation speed 2850 r.p.m. (motor frequency 50 Hz).</p><p><strong>2. Performance Curve</strong></p><p><strong><img alt=\"叶轮solar pump\" src=\"/Content/upload/2019348866/201901091705413360312.jpg\" title=\"叶轮solar pump\"/></strong></p><p><strong><img alt=\"image005(001).jpg\" src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808231526472492675.jpg\" style=\"white-space: normal;\"/></strong></p><p><strong>3. Spare Parts</strong></p><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"table\" width=\"100%\"><tbody><tr class=\"firstRow\"><td style=\"\" valign=\"top\" width=\"383\"><p>Plastic Impeller </p><p><img alt=\"image011(001).jpg\" src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808231528579817172.jpg\"/></p><p>·High durable plastic, long-time using, </p><p>sand resistant</p><p><br/></p></td><td style=\"\" valign=\"top\" width=\"383\"><p>Mechanical Seal</p><p><img alt=\"image013(001).jpg\" src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808231529078353459.jpg\"/></p><p>·Super-high precision Carborundum Graphite mechanical seal</p><p>·No oil-leakage keep the well safe</p><p><br/></p></td></tr><tr><td style=\"\" valign=\"top\" width=\"383\"><p>Stator</p><p><img alt=\"image015(001).jpg\" src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808231529179588508.jpg\"/></p><p>·Cold-rolled Silicon steel (800 grade) with full pieces</p><p>·Keep power durable and more efficiency</p><p><br/></p></td><td style=\"\" valign=\"top\" width=\"383\"><p>Pump Shaft</p><p><img alt=\"image017(001).jpg\" src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808231529266810168.jpg\"/></p><p>·Dia. 12mm</p><p>·Much stronger, no distortion(especially for the longer pumps)</p><p><br/></p></td></tr></tbody></table><p><strong>4. Technical data</strong></p><p>• Performance range: Flow up to 5.8 m3/h</p><p>• Head up to 80 m</p><p>• Voltage range: 220-415V</p><p>• Frequency: 50/60Hz</p><p>• Max. acceptable media temp: 35 °C</p><p>• Pump diameter: Ø98 mm</p><p>• Thread connections: RP 1’’ – RP 2’’</p><p>• Minimum well diameter: Ø100 mm</p><p>• Materials: Stainless steel casing with plastic impeller</p><p>• The 4 inch submersible impeller pump can be installed vertically or horizontally</p><p><strong>5. Product Application</strong></p><p>Liquid type: clean water</p><p>Uses: domestic, civil, agricultural, industrial</p><p>Applications: Ground water supply systems, irrigation pumps, fire-fighting sets, pressure systems</p><p><img alt=\"image019(001).jpg\" src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808231532518618815.jpg\"/></p><p><br/></p><p><br/></p>\n</div>\n<p class=\"productsTags\"> Hot Tags: solar submersible impeller pump, China, suppliers, manufacturers, buy</p>\n<div class=\"ptit\">Related Products</div>\n<ul class=\"rollPro1\">\n<li>\n<div class=\"pbox\"><a href=\"/2-5-submersible-pump/2-5-inch-subme